{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026WaK6wvPM7m1792723421.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>曾在選秀節目《聲秀》與《玄戰》中憑藉甜美精緻五官備受關注的甄敏芳（Jenny），繼早前以斜膊紅裙亮眼現身音樂會後，近日又在社交平台分享了一系列極具「男友視角」的美食照。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"799194f2-1509-4a32-895e-8d95b3d63586.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20262ukUBcfZWa1792723421.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"a3eccf82-2676-4ab6-9d54-a7ef5ffd8115.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026mrTWkovlfk1792723421.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p></p><p>相中的她身穿吊帶上衣，留言笑指相片由好友拍攝，更在餐桌前雙手托腮甜笑放電，甚至調皮地用叉子將小番茄擋在鼻前賣萌。這輯活潑可愛的靚相曝光後，隨即吸引大批網民圍觀讚好，紛紛直呼被她的甜美笑容徹底融化。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:43:47.965369+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:47:32.849563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:38:04.822557+00:00","content_hash":"6cbd9947ef60e8b7b0eb88d82908715f43200e6c97109c656091d873b29aa3fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:43:47.965369+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}